					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-8523545#post-4057701</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-8523545/scp-1134-j#post-4057701</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 13 Nov 2018 16:07:28 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>IceHinedere</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3023623</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Gave it a +1 because I personally found it entertaining.</p> <p>The only real problem I had was that I think you overused the &quot;[EXPLETIVE]&quot; thing a bit. Like the other guy said, maybe making the effect more gradual as the test goes on. At first, it'd be mildly confusing and a little annoying, then it would be fairly aggravating, then it starts to piss people off.</p> <p>Just my opinion tho. Thought it was entertaining as is, but I think some more dialogue in the test logs beside a storm of swears would make it better.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
